  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nThere seems to be no way to query the current admin of the room.\r\nThis is not available via https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/v1.38/admin_api/rooms.html#room-details-api.\r\n\r\nhttps://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/v1.38/admin_api/rooms.html#room-state-api seems to have this, but it's not clear (not well documented) how to parse the `m.room.power_levels` which I assume are what I am searching for.\r\n\r\nUser case:\r\nOn user deactivation (handled outside synapse), assign a new admin for all rooms the deactivated user is the admin of.\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n1. Add this info to https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/latest/admin_api/user_admin_api.html#account-data\r\n2. Add this info to https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/latest/admin_api/rooms.html#room-details-api\r\n3. Implement a new endpoint\r\n",
